    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Horde is Coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will arrive by nightfall, and you are woefully unprepared. With any luck, you'll make it out of this alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore your Surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/da68b55df47abc9f6998bedefd78fe2b.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 6 unique locations, you must scour all of them to prepare for the oncoming horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find and Craft Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the items you find and combine them together to create useful tools and traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch the Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/688b056b2a460487a0f2b3d4832656a9.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action costs valuable time. With only one day, you must use it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/3f2bea4b33759f0ab9a625d7cb501138.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hideout could use a few touch-ups, along with some elaborate traps. However, you'll need to find the right equipment for the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the Dawn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the right preparations, you may be able to fend off the horde and survive another day.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Horde is Coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will arrive by nightfall, and you are woefully unprepared. With any luck, you'll make it out of this alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore your Surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/da68b55df47abc9f6998bedefd78fe2b.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 6 unique locations, you must scour all of them to prepare for the oncoming horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find and Craft Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the items you find and combine them together to create useful tools and traps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch the Clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/688b056b2a460487a0f2b3d4832656a9.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action costs valuable time. With only one day, you must use it wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1760710/extras/3f2bea4b33759f0ab9a625d7cb501138.avif?t=1750127986\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your hideout could use a few touch-ups, along with some elaborate traps. However, you'll need to find the right equipment for the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the Dawn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the right preparations, you may be able to fend off the horde and survive another day.</p>",
    "short_description": "Infected Dawn is a singleplayer 3D point and click game focused on exploration and time management. Explore and scavenge useful items to prepare your hideout for the oncoming zombie horde.",
